WEBVTT

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:06.000
6:30 A.M. on April 21, 1648, Testament Era
Drawing Room, Inquisition Ship

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.520
Care to read a book?

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:09.900
Judge. Could you bring me one?

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:10.600
Tes.

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:11.860
Also...

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:16.240
I would like my clothes back.

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:20.040
Tes., I will return them once they've been cleaned.

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:23.250
Suicide?

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:24.000
Correct.

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:26.310
7:00 A.M.
Infirmary, Inquisition Ship

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:29.980
She may be an automated doll,

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.170
but her soul has assimilated an Armor of Deadly Sins.

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:36.950
The Far East is prohibited from possessing
a weapon of mass destruction.

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:39.600
As such, she must take responsibility
for the destruction of Mikawa

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.010
and return the Armor of Deadly Sins to the

00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:43.680
Testament Union by means of suicide.

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:45.450
I see...

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:53.570
Ouch! Hey, Gin!

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:55.610
Don't you have something to say?

00:00:55.770 --> 00:00:56.860
Ready, start!

00:00:57.260 --> 00:01:00.160
S-sorry to have worried you.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.580
Tes. And?

00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:04.460
Thanks for tending to me!

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:05.620
And?

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:07.630
I-I can't take any more!

00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:09.400
Deputy, how do you feel?

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:14.170
No, Gin! You're killing me here!

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:15.170
And?

00:01:15.170 --> 00:01:16.380
What?!

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:21.510
Uh, I just remembered.

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:23.010
And that is?

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:25.020
I'm back.

00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:30.600
Tes., welcome back.

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:53.260
Nani ga mieru?

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:53.260
What do you see?

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:56.680
Ari no mama no kimi wa

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:56.680
You've closed yourself off to love

00:01:56.680 --> 00:02:02.570
Tsuyoku naru made itoshisa wo tojite

00:01:56.680 --> 00:02:02.570
Until you grow innately strong

00:02:02.570 --> 00:02:05.650
Nani wo kiku no?

00:02:02.570 --> 00:02:05.650
What are you listening to?

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:08.740
Himitsu no kobeya de

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:08.740
Shall I tell you about days long past

00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:14.580
Inishie no hibi katarou ka?

00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:14.580
In our secret little room?

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:17.790
Kioku ni dakarete

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:17.790
Embraced in memories

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:21.080
Kudakareta mysteria

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:21.080
The mysteria crumbles

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:23.840
Higeki wo koete

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:23.840
Once you overcome this tragedy

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:26.050
Odayaka na inori

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:26.050
Offer a gentle prayer

00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:30.070
Owari ga hajimari

00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:30.070
Endings are just beginnings

00:02:30.070 --> 00:02:33.260
Shinsekai de hito wa mirai wo

00:02:30.070 --> 00:02:33.260
People toss aside all they have

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:35.850
Bishu no you ni

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:35.850
Without ever knowing

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:39.320
Nomi hoseru ka sae shirazu

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:39.320
If they could drink up the new world

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:42.480
Subete houri nageta

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:42.480
Like a savory wine

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:45.640
Shinsekai wa tsumetai risei to

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:45.640
The new world resides

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:48.360
Kiseki no hazama

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:48.360
Between boring logic and miracles

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:57.370
Doushite koko de kimi to aeta no

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:57.370
I wonder why this is where I first met you

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:09.430
7:58 A.M. Normal Land Port, Mikawa

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:10.430
The Provisional Council has decided

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:12.510
to link an assistant cargo ship to Musashi

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:14.980
8:04 A.M. Kakamigahara Checkpoint No.2, Mikawa

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:15.000
as a temporary residential district
for the refugees.

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:16.280
Over.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:17.960
Glad to hear it.

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:22.560
The proposal for control of Musashi
to transfer to the Testament Union

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:26.200
"Advocate at the Confession Grounds"

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:26.340
and relocate Musashi's residents to the
Matsudaira domain in Edo was accepted.

00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:27.390
Over.

00:03:27.590 --> 00:03:29.400
Oh, I see...

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:34.230
At any rate, it's safe to say I'm being detained, isn't it?

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:37.360
Judge. It's because you stayed and played,

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:41.170
despite your promise to only grab a quick drink. Over.

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:46.420
But it was so nostalgic that I kinda...

00:03:47.770 --> 00:03:48.580
You pissed?

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:52.470
I wish to ask about Lady Horizon. Over.

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:54.170
That was abrupt.

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:58.380
Don't you want to save Lady Horizon? Over.

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:00.660
But I'm not a student anymore.

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:02.220
I am well aware.

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:04.970
I, Shinagawa, have just arrived.

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:09.250
I just finished filing bail for Master Sakai. Over.

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:10.890
Sweet! In that case...

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:13.230
Leaving so soon?

00:04:14.510 --> 00:04:17.480
Galileo, President of Padova Academy?!

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:19.230
You mean former president.

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:24.360
I am currently the Vice-president of the
Chancellor Union in K.P.A. Italia, old boy.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:29.990
That heretic king isn't the only one dropping by.

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:33.410
Long time no see, Tadatsugu Sakai.

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:35.640
Innocentius...

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:38.460
I hear you're still the Chancellor.

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:44.740
It appears something happened between you. Over.

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:47.760
We scuffled a little about 20 years ago.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:51.770
I may have lost then, but this time I will win.

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:55.460
I'll take away the Far East's control over Musashi,

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:57.000
make it Mikawa's representative,

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:59.650
give you an Armor of Deadly Sins and put you

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:01.410
in the frontline against P.A. ODA.

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:02.270
I will not-

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:09.660
What's the matter, old boy?

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:12.870
It's a type of unorthodox spell.

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:15.460
Heliocentric Galileo, eh?

00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:18.460
There's more to me than that, old boy.

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:20.500
Really? That's pretty cool.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:26.050
Hear me, Sakai. K.P.A. Italia
will take back everything it lost.

00:05:27.940 --> 00:05:30.510
Even at the cost of someone's life?

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:34.730
Tes.!

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:42.340
8:43 A.M. Musashi Ariadust Academy

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:42.520
Let's review our current situation, okay?

00:05:42.930 --> 00:05:46.360
By inheriting rule over Mikawa,
Horizon also gained the power

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:50.590
to represent
the Far East and control over Musashi.

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:52.490
But the Testament Union will revoke all that

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:54.360
when she commits suicide.

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:57.540
So the entire Far East is in a dire pinch.

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:01.380
Plus King Yoshinao has taken back all our authority

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:03.630
and won't make any statements.

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:06.880
And it feels like we aren't in tune with each other.

00:06:07.350 --> 00:06:13.310
Let's see, Miriam, Mito, Masa, Seijun
and Azuma are all absent.

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:15.180
And...

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:19.900
After that incident, Aoi got chewed out until morning.

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:21.280
I see...

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:26.070
Suzu Mukai: About School Today
Toussaint: Information on the Situation
Tomo: You got it
Azuma: Sorry

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:26.070
Contents: Sorry
 From: Azuma
 To: Heidi Ogasawara
 Sorry.
 I can't make class today.
 ~Azuma

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:26.410
Azuma and Miriam are under the Guard's "protection".

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:28.240
So they can't leave their dorm.

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:32.410
Masa's at Musashi's Engineering Club
meeting in the central drive.

00:06:32.980 --> 00:06:36.510
And Mito's attending Musashi's Nobility Club meeting

00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:38.740
with all the local landowners.

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:41.420
Mito's in a tough spot.

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:42.720
Right.

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:45.630
If Horizon commits suicide and the
Matsudaira main branch dies out,

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:50.810
the Mito-Mitotsudaira branch will become
the Far East's representatives.

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:52.890
What an icky predicament...

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:55.930
Lastly, about Seijun.

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:58.090
Out of all of us, he's the only

00:06:58.090 --> 00:07:00.990
one who retained his authority as Vice-president.

00:07:01.450 --> 00:07:04.900
It's because his father is on the Provisional Council.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:08.360
Those siding with the Testament Union
want to use him as a pawn.

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:10.820
He'll make for a formidable foe.

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:14.530
Honda's skills as an orator shouldn't be taken lightly.

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:31.760
I wonder if everyone's trying to save Horizon...

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:34.970
Well, a lot's going on,

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:36.670
but who wants to save Horizon

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:39.680
and prevent a change in authority over Musashi?

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:44.060
Huh? No hands?

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:47.360
We need more info. Why don't you present that first?

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:50.150
You've got a point.

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:53.530
Shiro, got a sec?

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:54.780
What is it?

00:07:55.130 --> 00:07:57.920
I'd like you to share your opinion as a merchant.

00:07:57.920 --> 00:07:59.950
I'm in the middle of work.

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:03.960
But I think this is a big business chance.

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:05.710
Money?! Money's involved?!

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:07.440
Fine, I'll talk.

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:08.670
Everyone listen up!

00:08:09.070 --> 00:08:10.920
Scumbag!

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:12.890
Shut up and listen.

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:15.960
Now then, let me tell you what'll happen

00:08:15.960 --> 00:08:17.760
if we oppose the Testament Union.

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:24.120
Be
TCNAS
Far East Settlement

00:08:18.650 --> 00:08:22.330
First, Musashi won't be able to
replenish supplies at any ports.

00:08:22.670 --> 00:08:27.380
This would mean our death as we only
produce 10% of our food.

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:32.480
Wait, doesn't Musashi have its own fields?

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:33.700
It's not enough.

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:36.180
Musashi's population is just under 100,000.

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:37.410
Even if you turned

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:40.340
the Takao or Ome ships into nothing but fields,

00:08:40.340 --> 00:08:42.880
it's not enough to support everyone.

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:45.340
And we lack the manpower to support it.

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:46.920
Got it?

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:49.460
I-I feel like I've lost...

00:08:49.780 --> 00:08:51.250
Fret not.

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:53.850
Ohiroshiki ought to know that much as he's in the

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:56.010
Cooking Club and has a lolita complex.

00:08:56.240 --> 00:09:00.470
Judge. That's a lolita-loving member
of the Cooking Club for you.

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:04.890
No! I don't have a lolita complex!

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:09.420
In Testament-based Europe,
the major "worship vitality" belief

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:13.860
equals a type of religion
that worships the vitality in youth.

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:17.570
Uh-huh, just don't get caught while you're in school.

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:19.340
You've got it all wrong!

00:09:19.340 --> 00:09:20.810
Back to business.

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:23.660
Musashi's reserves would only last for two weeks.

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:27.150
So it's game over if we defy the Testament Union.

00:09:27.150 --> 00:09:29.000
Oh? You think so?

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:33.340
Mr. Scrooge, don't be mean and tell them already.

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:35.530
It's quite simple.

00:09:35.530 --> 00:09:38.640
In order to gain supplies
despite defying the Testament Union

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:42.010
we must force Masazumi Honda to side with us.

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:45.520
Sh-Shiro, that was kinda cool.

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:50.560
Yeah, right. But how do we pull that off?

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:57.630
First we'd need to do something about
our moronic Chancellor/president.

00:10:01.090 --> 00:10:02.500
Hey, hey, hey!

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:03.740
It's class time!

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:07.210
Today you'll be composing essays.

00:10:07.610 --> 00:10:10.080
Essays, ma'am?

00:10:10.270 --> 00:10:13.540
Yep! You get one and a half hours.

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:15.840
The topic is "What I Want To Do".

00:10:17.690 --> 00:10:19.800
But first...

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:22.500
I want you to watch this.

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:26.970
I think it'll give you a hint for the topic
"What I Want To Do".

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:28.370
9:01 A.M.
Hillside by the Normal Land Port, Mikawa

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:42.950
Uh, Gin? Why am I just standing here?

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:49.040
Tes. It is important that we show K.P.A. Italia
that you are well.

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:53.000
Were our forces that heavily exhausted?

00:10:56.620 --> 00:11:00.330
The Far East's Colonel, Futayo Honda, wishes to talk.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.300
Third Special Agent!

00:11:13.490 --> 00:11:17.300
Tadakatsu Honda of the Far East's Mikawa area

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:20.210
and Shin-Nagoya Castle Academy special reservist

00:11:20.210 --> 00:11:23.930
