colleague of three years, Futayo Honda.

00:11:25.020 --> 00:11:27.040
What of my father?

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:29.590
He shared a great deal with me.

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:31.540
Is that so?

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:38.770
<i>This is being broadcast to Musashi and Mikawa's refugees, </i>

00:11:38.770 --> 00:11:40.800
<i>as well as to other countries.</i>

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:43.890
<i>At this rate, the Far East's people </i>

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:46.430
<i>will surrender to the Testament Union,</i>

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:51.380
<i>get swept along and ultimately accept
whatever is in store for them.</i>

00:11:51.860 --> 00:11:54.400
<i>But if I make my move now...</i>

00:11:56.030 --> 00:12:00.400
<i>I'll prove that power and weaponry
are still within the Far East's grasp.</i>

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:01.650
<i>So I must...</i>

00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:02.180
sgniW gniraoS
detavitcA

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:07.290
<i>...take Slicing Dragonfly away from Gin Tachibana!</i>

00:12:17.050 --> 00:12:19.790
<i>She was trying to save face for the Far East.</i>

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:20.590
<i>But...</i>

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:31.270
I hereby return the Shinto weapon Slicing Dragonfly.

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:33.980
I appreciate it.

00:12:34.360 --> 00:12:37.540
I, Futayo Honda, swear upon Slicing Dragonfly

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:39.760
that I shall surpass my father in rank.

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:44.540
<i>Is anyone in the Far East </i>

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:48.010
<i>even capable of sharing in her resolution?</i>

00:12:58.820 --> 00:13:01.740
9:30 A.M.
Musashi Ariadust Academy

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:05.910
"What I Want To Do"

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:17.620
<i>If that hadn't happened yesterday,</i>

00:13:17.620 --> 00:13:20.300
<i>today would be the big day he popped the question.</i>

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:25.370
<i>I... no, everyone, just wanted...</i>

00:13:25.370 --> 00:13:29.580
