00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:34.080
<i>Let's see. First he'd fondle her boobs.</i>

00:13:34.490 --> 00:13:36.960
<i>No, no! That's too fast, even for him.</i>

00:13:37.640 --> 00:13:39.890
