00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:55.730
<i>Hm, how far would they go?</i>

00:13:56.150 --> 00:13:59.080
<i>This far? No, maybe this far...</i>

00:13:59.570 --> 00:14:01.590
<i>Eh?! That far?!</i>

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:08.130
Yes, ma'am?

00:14:08.130 --> 00:14:10.310
Do you need more paper?

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:13.200
Tori got boobs. He decided he's gotta grope Horizon's boobs. 
Tori doesn't get politics. Tori is the Chancellor and president of the Student Council.
He strips and plays erotic games. But he's very particular when it comes to boobs.
Tori was supposed to leave home today and walk a rather long distance to 
Blue Thunder in Tama. Tori lives with his unique 18-year old... 
and I mean unique sister. Not that she matters any. Wait, no she does. 
At any rate, the big day was coming up soon. As such, Tori held a meeting on the bridge to discuss the art of confessing one's feelings.
He naturally asked the ninja about his failed attempts and then got sent flying after he groped the knight's boobs.
Yep, he sure did. Tori has a childhood friend. It is Tenzo.

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:18.720
Time! Everyone's about done. So, Asama!

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:19.400
Yes?!

