00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:53.410
Um, could someone read it?

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:56.180
Asama, read it for her.

00:14:58.830 --> 00:14:59.870
Here.

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:01.130
Are you sure?

00:15:01.610 --> 00:15:02.380
Judge.

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:09.510
Then I'll present for you.

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:12.250
"What I Want To Do."

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:14.480
By Suzu Mukai from Class 3-Plum.

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:17.430
"I have someone I love."

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:20.020
"I have for ages."

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:22.050
"We met a long time ago."

00:15:22.050 --> 00:15:24.730
"It was at our elementary's Welcoming Ceremony."

00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:28.840
I didn't wanna go.

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:31.320
I didn't wanna go to the Academy.

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:37.010
In my family, my mom and dad
have work in the morning.

00:15:37.460 --> 00:15:39.320
They couldn't make it.

00:15:39.990 --> 00:15:42.910
I went to the Welcoming Ceremony alone.

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:49.410
But I didn't cry so I wouldn't worry my mom and dad.

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:53.970
Still, I wanted them to congratulate me.

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:59.310
The Academy was high up on the upper layer.

00:15:59.690 --> 00:16:03.060
I hate staircases and there was a long one.

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:06.530
So I thought in front of the staircase,

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:11.320
"Do I have to climb up that
if no one will praise me for it?"

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:17.220
No one there noticed me as they went up
with their moms and dads.

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:20.310
I was all alone.

00:16:20.760 --> 00:16:21.800
But then...

00:16:22.380 --> 00:16:24.110
Hey, what's wrong?

00:16:24.110 --> 00:16:26.030
Why are you crying?

00:16:26.030 --> 00:16:27.750
They were by themselves.

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:30.570
Their moms and dads were at work.

00:16:32.350 --> 00:16:33.260
Let's go!

00:16:33.730 --> 00:16:38.490
Really? The ceremony'll start. You'll be late.

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:41.420
That's cool! I'm a delinquent.

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:42.230
A what?

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:44.350
C'mon, let's go.

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:50.860
I still remember...

00:16:52.470 --> 00:16:55.910
...the wind's smell and the sound of the falling sakura.

00:16:55.910 --> 00:17:01.800
Before I knew it, I had scaled the stairs on my own.

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:10.630
Congrats!

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:12.630
Let's be friends.

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:21.890
"When I went home and told Mom and Dad about it,

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:24.890
it made them happy and they congratulated me."

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:27.230
"They said, 'Good job!'"

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:29.860
"It made me cry again."

00:17:31.130 --> 00:17:34.440
"Middle school was on the second floor,
so there were no stairs."

00:17:35.020 --> 00:17:40.200
"The high school has stairs out front,
but I climbed them on my own."

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:45.960
"But only once, on my way to the
Welcoming Ceremony, Tori took my hand."

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:50.820
It was my left hand, which Horizon had once held.

00:17:55.570 --> 00:17:59.290
But Horizon wasn't there.

00:18:01.460 --> 00:18:03.220
"I love someone."

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:06.190
"I love Tori."

00:18:06.970 --> 00:18:08.690
"I love Horizon."

00:18:09.210 --> 00:18:10.840
"I love everyone."

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:15.310
"And most of all, I love Tori when he's with Horizon."

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:19.250
"Please! I'll be okay on my own now."

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:23.760
"So just like when you took my hand-

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:28.290
Please! Save Horizon, Tori!

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:37.000
Hey, now, Bell! Don't underestimate me.

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:39.290
I was planning on doing just that.

00:18:40.320 --> 00:18:43.560
Don't worry, Tori Aoi is here!

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:45.470
Tori...

00:18:46.010 --> 00:18:49.440
Yep, that's me! I'm Tori!

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:51.310
Uh-um...

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.530
I'll be okay.

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:03.240
I'm all grown up now, you know?

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:06.000
Yep. It's incredible but true.

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:10.820
So I'm not like I used to be.

00:19:10.820 --> 00:19:11.580
Yeah.

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:17.160
Let me load for a bit longer!

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:19.180
Don't kill the mood!

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:23.430
Hey, Bell. Can I amend one part?

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:24.890
Wh-what's that?

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:29.170
I don't hold your hand out of concern.

00:19:29.170 --> 00:19:33.250
Bell, you're so cute and kind
that I wanna hold your hand.

00:19:33.580 --> 00:19:34.860
Everyone agree?

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:36.730
Judge!

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:40.490
Thank you...

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:41.860
Yup!

00:19:42.120 --> 00:19:44.240
Finally up after crying yourself to sleep?

00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:46.100
Huh?! Say what?!

00:19:46.100 --> 00:19:47.700
Go check that out!

00:19:49.140 --> 00:19:52.540
Foolish brother, what's with the naughty magazine?

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:52.540
Linking Multiple Covers
Extra Large Collection of
Silver-Haired Characters 1!!

00:19:53.650 --> 00:19:56.430
It's a special edition one with silver-haired babes, isn't it?

00:19:56.430 --> 00:19:59.590
Yep, 'cause Horizon's one.

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:02.040
I snatched it after it got confiscated in the guard post,

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:04.900
and spent the morning charging up
my manliness gauge.

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:09.210
You had me cover for you back there so you

00:20:09.210 --> 00:20:11.560
could get ready to charge your gauge?

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:13.490
I really appreciate it, Teach!

00:20:13.490 --> 00:20:18.570
But don't get upset 'cause my
pure and clean ways are lost on you.

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:23.070
I can't believe you're still a kid at 100,027 years old-

00:20:27.180 --> 00:20:32.600
Ah, Mitsuki! Sorry 'bout that. I'll patch it up later.

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:35.770
Sorry for the fuss.

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:43.400
So, how exactly do you plan to rescue Horizon?

00:20:43.400 --> 00:20:45.830
Now that's a toughie...

00:20:45.830 --> 00:20:47.600
I'm at a loss.

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:49.390
Hey, Shiro!

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:50.510
Yeah, moron?

00:20:50.510 --> 00:20:52.920
Pick up where you left off.

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:54.060
It'll cost you.

00:20:54.880 --> 00:20:57.070
We'll hold a special Student Council Meeting.

00:20:57.070 --> 00:20:58.820
But we can't do that, remember?

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:01.490
We can only do that if the

00:21:01.490 --> 00:21:05.160
Chancellor is the only one with any authority around.

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:10.290
So that's why they let Masazumi
retain authority as Vice-president.

00:21:11.600 --> 00:21:13.860
You just figure that out, moron!

00:21:13.860 --> 00:21:15.400
Ms. O.

00:21:16.060 --> 00:21:17.020
Yes?

00:21:17.020 --> 00:21:21.640
Isn't there a way to hold that meeting
despite our predicament?

00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:24.380
More or less.

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:29.290
A special Student Council Meeting
held by normal students...

00:21:29.290 --> 00:21:31.060
It could be for only one thing:

00:21:31.570 --> 00:21:33.810
To pass a vote of no-confidence.

00:21:35.090 --> 00:21:38.410
If Masazumi doesn't come,
he'll be dismissed as Vice-president

00:21:38.410 --> 00:21:42.070
and since no one of authority's left,
we can hold a special meeting.

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:44.860
And if he comes, it will be an official meeting.

00:21:45.510 --> 00:21:49.030
Either way, we'll be able to make our decision.

00:21:49.030 --> 00:21:55.540
We'll decide what to do about Horizon,
Musashi, the Far East and ourselves.

00:21:56.960 --> 00:21:59.030
That's all I had to say.

00:21:59.030 --> 00:22:01.300
Would you like to make any closing remarks?

00:22:03.390 --> 00:22:06.340
I'm a dumpling!

00:22:07.420 --> 00:22:09.110
N-not again!

00:22:10.530 --> 00:22:13.200
10:15 A.M.
Drawing Room, Inquisition Ship

00:22:16.780 --> 00:22:17.780
Um...

00:22:17.780 --> 00:22:18.940
What is it?

00:22:19.490 --> 00:22:23.370
Lady Horizon, are you sure about this?

00:22:24.250 --> 00:22:25.400
I can't say.

00:22:26.790 --> 00:22:27.780
It's just...

00:22:28.540 --> 00:22:32.410
When I heard of my origins, this crossed my mind:

00:22:33.510 --> 00:22:39.250
"I'd rather be a worker at a café
than a sovereign if I had the choice."

00:22:40.850 --> 00:22:45.310
I probably won't get to meet
different kinds of people there ever again.

00:22:46.080 --> 00:22:54.590
Kizu darake no yuuki wo daite aruki dasu yo

00:22:46.080 --> 00:22:54.590
I embrace my battered courage as I step forward

00:22:54.870 --> 00:23:02.890
Kono te de asu wo tsukuri dasu to kimeta kara

00:22:54.870 --> 00:23:02.890
I have decided to forge tomorrow with my own hands

00:23:04.020 --> 00:23:08.380
Saa, hoshi yo, terashite

00:23:04.020 --> 00:23:08.380
Oh, stars, shine upon

00:23:08.650 --> 00:23:13.040
Koko ni ima umareta melody

00:23:08.650 --> 00:23:13.040
The melody that was just born here

00:23:13.040 --> 00:23:17.540
Sono egao wo tonari de

00:23:13.040 --> 00:23:17.540
I would like to see that

00:23:17.850 --> 00:23:21.510
Mite itai to omoun da

00:23:17.850 --> 00:23:21.510
Smile of yours up close

00:23:22.310 --> 00:23:31.240
Itami ni tsuranukarete, kimi no na wo sakenda

00:23:22.310 --> 00:23:31.240
Piercing with pain, I screamed out your name

00:23:31.240 --> 00:23:41.270
Mada tooi kyoukai no ue de itsuka tsutaetai

00:23:31.240 --> 00:23:41.270
Someday I wish to tell you something on the horizon

00:23:39.770 --> 00:23:44.590
Itoshisa no fiore...

00:23:39.770 --> 00:23:44.590
My precious fiore...

00:24:07.190 --> 00:24:11.030
Next Episode
Musashi's Knights
